  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 2 of RUST BORROWING & LIFETIMES. The borrow checker is not fighting you — it is asking one question you have not answered: which region of code must this reference stay valid for? 10 pages of dense field notes: shared vs mutable borrows, NLL and two-phase borrows, lifetime elision in three rules, reborrows and splitting, interior mutability costs, and every borrow error code with the fix that actually works. Save it for the next time rustc prints three line numbers at you.",
